    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Spratt have received instructions to offer for sale by Private Treaty this residential holding providing for a single storey cottage standing on 8.27ha / 20.43 acres all contained within a separate Land Registry Folio. The holding has independent private vehicular access off the bounding public roadway and the entire holding is contained within one block of ground all presented in grass and well sheltered by mature boundaries. The lands fall in a southerly direction from the public road and the inner section benefits from traditional style dry stone walls typical of what one would see in Connemara. The holding is conveniently located only 11 km south west of Dungarvan Town and 7.7km west of the N25 Main Waterford - Cork Road. This holding provides for a rare opportunity to benefit from an existing Planning Precedent with options to refurbish / extend or to consider other options under the current Planning Guidelines.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Natural water source\nElectricity supply adjacent to cottage, potential for reconnection"
